1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,700
Forty-seven tabs. Twelve job boards. One resume… and zero replies.

2
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:09,800
Don't hunt for a job alone.

3
00:00:11,733 --> 00:00:24,767
For TCU students, the search is scattered — across Handshake, LinkedIn, and dozens of company sites. Tailoring every application takes hours. And there are only so many advising slots.

4
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:34,467
We're TCU students. We lived this. So we set out to turn every student's background into real decisions — and real next steps.

5
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:43,633
Meet Remy. A personal AI career coach that finds the roles that fit you — and helps you go after them, honestly.

6
00:00:44,567 --> 00:00:46,833
Start with what you already have.

7
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:52,300
Remy asks what you want — not the other way around.

8
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:01,833
Then it finds real, open roles — and your strongest match for each.

9
00:01:04,967 --> 00:01:12,300
No templates. Remy asks a few questions, then rewrites your real experience — every change tied to the posting.

10
00:01:13,967 --> 00:01:16,933
You see your score — and exactly why it moved.

11
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:24,067
It connects you with TCU alumni in your field, and helps you write the first email.

12
00:01:27,633 --> 00:01:30,567
Every application and deadline, in one place.

13
00:01:32,633 --> 00:01:40,767
Once, our AI wrote “fast-paced office.” The resume never said that. We caught it — and taught Remy to catch it every time.

14
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:43,533
And it's live today.

15
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:53,600
And this is just the start.

16
00:01:57,433 --> 00:02:03,533
Every student should understand their options — and build a path that's theirs. Don't hunt for a job alone.

